  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to trust and cooperation between both banks of the Nistru River in the area of emergency healthcare</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The strategic goal of the proposed Project is to achieve an enhanced environment of trust and cooperation across the Transnistrian conflict divide through joint work on improving the living standards of men and women from the left bank, via safer and more equitable access to emergency healthcare services.</narrative>
  </description>
